      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This is the end of everything— \r\nUntil someone reveals the truth, \r\nFinnegan and I will rest here forever.",
        "Jp" : "これで全てが終わる――\r\nいつか誰かに暴かれるまで、私とフィネガンは\r\nここに永遠の眠りにつくのだ"
