      "MsgSerial" : 551558,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To those who have made it here, \r\nyou must have overcome many trials \r\nto arrive at this moment. \r\nEven as I perish, \r\nmy devoted followers \r\nwill continue my legacy.",
        "Jp" : "辿り着いた者たちよ\r\nここまで来るには多くの苦難があったことだろう\r\n我が身はここで朽ちるとも\r\n遺した従者たちが志を継ぐ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551561,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I have wronged them greatly— \r\nyet for those who remain to survive \r\nand achieve their goals, \r\na glimmer of hope is essential.",
        "Jp" : "彼女らには気の毒なことをした――\r\nだが遺されし者が生き抜き、事を成すためには\r\n微かでも希望が必要なのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 551564,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 1,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
